<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Refripar started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Refripar started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Santander Investment said it has initiated coverage of Brazilian white-goods maker Refripar with a buy recommendation and set a 12-to-18 month price target of $3.06 on its preferred share, up 21.9 percent from current levels .</p>
<p>-- &quot;Refripar, Brazil's second-largest white goods producer, has benefitted from its recent acquisition by international white goods giant Electrolux,&quot; the investment bank said in a statement.</p>
</text>
